{
  "_note": "Generated by scripts/gen-templates.mjs from a compact spec. Safe to edit by hand; re-running the generator overwrites it.",
  "id": "dusk-register",
  "name": "Dusk Register",
  "tagline": "Bone type, flush left on charcoal",
  "idea": "Replaces brass-rail twice over: it was the existing mangni-brass — same Ivory Midnight ground, same modern recipe, same brass bar — and it put Italiana on a design listed for weddings, where a twenty-two character compound name autofits down and that face collapses. The civil register keeps its flush-left letterhead idea and moves it to the one piece of Ink Smoke nothing else occupies, left-aligned with no frame, so a dark card with type pushed to one rail reads nothing like the three centred smoke classics. Foil is off because the engine's accent bar is 2px and foil on a bar is a swatch; the gradient is off because a wash behind a single column adds a phone wallpaper and no idea.",
  "categories": [
    "wedding",
    "reception",
    "anniversary"
  ],
  "fieldset": "couple",
